sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Group Chat UI
  participant Worker as Trigger.dev (chat-agent)
  participant BotA as Bot A (Planner)
  participant BotB as Bot B (Coder)

  User->>UI: "@Planner please design and build the feature"
  UI->>Worker: Dispatch turn with designated responder: Bot A
  Worker->>BotA: Invoke with group roster and system instructions
  BotA->>Worker: Stream text planning steps
  BotA->>Worker: Call handoff({ targetBotId: "bot-b", summary: "Plan approved. Implement code." })
  Worker->>UI: Stream handoff divider element
  Worker->>Worker: Switch active persona, memory & sandbox to Bot B
  Worker->>BotB: Invoke with handoff summary & context
  BotB->>Worker: Execute code in Bot B's Daytona container
  BotB->>Worker: Stream completion message
  Worker->>UI: Stream final response & finish turn
